{"id":328028363,"name":"Typical Colors 2","desc":"Dive into intense battles with over 200 unique weapons at your disposal!\nPlay as an offensive, defensive, or support role to push your team to victory.\nThis game is heavily inspired by Team Fortress 2.\n\nMobile Players: iOS devices are known to run much better than Android, if you have an android phone, make sure you have at least 6+ gb of Ram.\n\nNOTICE: If you're noticing any frame drops, reduce your graphics quality and mess around with the game's settings [Main Menu > Settings (Top Right) > Graphics] (The game disables some visual features for better frames).\n\nBasic Keyboard and Mouse Bindings:\nM  -  Main Menu\nW  -  Walk Forward\nS  -  Walk Backward\nA  -  Walk Left\nD  -  Walk Right\nSpace  -  Jump\nCtrl  -  Crouch\nQ  -  Previous Weapon\nE  - Call for Doctor\nTab - Show Scoreboard\nNumbers keys 1,2,3,4,5 - Select weapon\nScroll Wheel - Select weapons\nLeft Mouse Button  -  Primary Fire\nRight Mouse Button -  Secondary Fire\nY or / - Open All chat\nU - Open Team Chat","path":"/game/328028363-typical-colors-2","slug":"328028363-typical-colors-2","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b94d75ffe22f8ea405b815a6ace2b744/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ef234f1586b8c8090eab8c514008bb33/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":808,"visitor":208839772,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-21T18:44:08.341Z","creator":{"name":"Dorcus Digital","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":22,"freeCount":21,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0},"page":2,"next":null,"total":2,"scripts":[{"slug":"Typical-Colors-2-Projectile-Spam-6574","_id":"64cac415ee07f2394f8f01b8","title":"Projectile Spam","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78141","gameId":328028363,"name":"Typical Colors 2","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-ef234f1586b8c8090eab8c514008bb33-b1d776ab7e64.png","placeId":328028363},"features":"Re-uploaded because i couldn't get into my first account due to the cookie deletion.\n\nHow 2 Use\n\n